<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Explorers Index jumps 1.3 pct in week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Explorers Index jumps 1.3 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perth stockbroker Eyres Reed Ltd said its Australian Explorers Index rose 48.7 points or 1.34 percent in the week to Friday. The All Ordinaries index fell by 0.29 percent however. Changes, in percent:</p>
<p>	    Feb  21 Feb 14   pct   1 Month  pct    1 Year  pct</p>
<p>Explorers 3671.3  3622.6 (+1.34) 3509.4 (+4.61)  2605.8(+40.89)</p>
<p>ASX Gold  1803.5  1761.9 (+2.37) 1731.8 (+4.14)  2077.0(-13.17)</p>
<p>All Ords  2475.3  2482.6 (-0.29) 2430.1 (+1.86)  2238.1 (+10.6)</p>
<p>Oil &amp; Gas 1575.5  1597.8 (-1.39) 1570.5 (+0.32)  1106.9 (+42.33)</p>
<p>NOTE: The explorers index (base 500, March 1992) tracks the performance of 88 small capitalisation exploration companies.</p>
</text>
